Dragon is a [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessian]] and a great collector of knowledge. He found a tear in the crystal sphere of [[Geography/Ushas/index|Ushas]] and wished to see inside, since Ushas lies so far out of the way that little is written about it in the wider world.

It was from Dragon that the party that would found [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] first heard the name Thessian. He told them of the four generations, and named the five Thessians that had been on Ushas at one time or another: [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Harrow|Leitmotif]], [[Geography/Althane/The Archive|Archive]], Dragon himself, [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Mephistopheles|Mephistopheles]] and [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Uriel|Uriel]]. He met them only once.
